illegal::type_in_data
I found a type definition that has unsupported inhabitants.

Data-types cannot contain values of type fn(Int) -> Int because they aren't serialisable into a Plutus Data. Yet this is necessary for inhabitants of compound structures like List, Tuple or Fuzzer.
